API Gateway / Ingress Controller Contain.diagram:
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml
LAYOUT_WITH_LEGEND()

Container_Boundary(api_gateway_boundary, "API Gateway / Ingress Controller Containers") {
    Component(Ingress_Router_TLS_Termination, "Ingress Router & TLS Termination", "Google Cloud Platform Ingress / Envoy", "Manages ingress routing, mTLS connections from global traffic, and TLS termination.")
    Component(Rate_Limiting_Schema_Validation_Middleware, "Rate Limiting & Schema Validation Middleware", "Envoy Proxy", "Enforces token-bucket rate limiting and validates incoming request schemas, standardizing error responses using RFC 7807.")
}

Rel(Ingress_Router_TLS_Termination, Rate_Limiting_Schema_Validation_Middleware, "Routes validated ingress requests to", "")

@enduml

Consent Enforcement Middleware/Proxy Con.diagram:
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml
LAYOUT_WITH_LEGEND()

title Component diagram for the Consent Enforcement Middleware/Proxy Containers container

Container_Boundary(consent_middleware, "Consent Enforcement Middleware/Proxy Containers") {
    Component(EnvoyIngressRouter, "Envoy Ingress Router", "Envoy Proxy", "Handles incoming ingress traffic routing and inspects W3C Trace Context headers (traceparent).")
    Component(ExtAuthzFilter, "ExtAuthz Filter", "Envoy ExtAuthz Filter", "Enforces strict default-deny privacy controls and intercepts requests to validate JWT tokens and enforce consent.")
    Component(MetadataEnrichmentAgent, "Metadata Enrichment Agent", "Custom Middleware", "Enriches requests with metadata headers like X-Consent-Purpose and X-Data-Residency-Region before forwarding.")
}

Rel(EnvoyIngressRouter, ExtAuthzFilter, "Routes incoming client requests for authorization", "HTTPS / gRPC")
Rel(ExtAuthzFilter, MetadataEnrichmentAgent, "Passes validated and authorized requests for header enrichment", "")
@enduml

Stateless Core Application Containers.diagram:
